          'Size `pm.max_children` mathematically: `(Available Container RAM - OS/Nginx headroom) / Average PHP-FPM Worker RSS` (e.g., `1500MB / 40MB ≈ 37` workers)—setting `max_children` too high triggers Linux OOM kills under traffic spikes!',
